{"id":"f4d41d3758401af0","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ctl-tc-translation.md","title":"CTL 的两变量 TC 翻译函数","display":"df-ctl-tc-translation — CTL 的两变量 TC 翻译函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ctl-tc-translation","aliases":["29-df-ctl-tc-translation"],"display":"df-ctl-tc-translation — CTL 的两变量 TC 翻译函数","depends_on":["[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","[[29-df-fo-tc]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem14.29 and proof, p.238, scan253; EX example, p.237, scan252","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层及扫描253原图；两变量目标文法、EX 子句与严格环展开为本地显式重建"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ctl-tc-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ctl-tc-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ctl-tc-translation — CTL 的两变量 TC 翻译函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98a7b2fe455fde6b\" href=\"?note=98a7b2fe455fde6b\" title=\"29-df-fo-tc\">29-df-fo-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem14.29 and proof, p.238, scan253; EX example, p.237, scan252"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层及扫描253原图；两变量目标文法、EX 子句与严格环展开为本地显式重建"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k=\\langle R^{(2)},p_0^{(1)},\\ldots,p_{k-1}^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_k=\\langle R^{(2)},p_0^{(1)},\\ldots,p_{k-1}^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 是互异的域变量名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\{x,y\\}\">\\(Z=\\{x,y\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,z\\in Z\">\\(u,v,z\\in Z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span> 及其构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathcal C_k\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathcal C_k\\)</span>。目标语法及 TC 绑定含义采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98a7b2fe455fde6b\" href=\"?note=98a7b2fe455fde6b\" title=\"29-df-fo-tc\">29-df-fo-tc</a>；TC 的体内 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 被绑定，应用位置的端点变量不在该绑定范围。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\">\\(\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_c^z,\\Gamma_c(u,v),\\Delta_c^z\">\\(T_c^z,\\Gamma_c(u,v),\\Delta_c^z\\)</span> 是下式构造的元语言语法对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 只是公式缩写，不是加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k\">\\(\\tau_k\\)</span> 的关系符号。所有缩写在使用处按其各自括号作用域展开；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的严格子树递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline x\\coloneqq y,\\qquad\\overline y\\coloneqq x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline x\\coloneqq y,\\qquad\\overline y\\coloneqq x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{k,0}^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{u=v,R(u,v)\\mid u,v\\in Z\\}\\cup\\{p_i(u)\\mid u\\in Z\\land 0\\leq i&lt;k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_{k,0}^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{u=v,R(u,v)\\mid u,v\\in Z\\}\\cup\\{p_i(u)\\mid u\\in Z\\land 0\\leq i&lt;k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{k,j+1}^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y}\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta,\\theta\\land\\eta,\\exists u\\,\\theta\\mid\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y},\\ u\\in Z\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{TC}_{x,y}\\theta](u,v)\\mid\\theta\\in\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y},\\ u,v\\in Z\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_{k,j+1}^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y}\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta,\\theta\\land\\eta,\\exists u\\,\\theta\\mid\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y},\\ u\\in Z\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{TC}_{x,y}\\theta](u,v)\\mid\\theta\\in\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y},\\ u,v\\in Z\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\top_c}^z\\coloneqq(z=z),\\qquad T_{\\bot_c}^z\\coloneqq\\neg(z=z),\\qquad T_{q_i}^z\\coloneqq p_i(z)\\quad(i&lt;k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\top_c}^z\\coloneqq(z=z),\\qquad T_{\\bot_c}^z\\coloneqq\\neg(z=z),\\qquad T_{q_i}^z\\coloneqq p_i(z)\\quad(i&lt;k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathsf{neg}(c)}^z\\coloneqq\\neg T_c^z,\\qquad T_{\\mathsf{and}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq T_c^z\\land T_d^z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\mathsf{neg}(c)}^z\\coloneqq\\neg T_c^z,\\qquad T_{\\mathsf{and}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq T_c^z\\land T_d^z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_c(u,v)\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{TC}_{x,y}(R(x,y)\\land T_c^x)](u,v),\\qquad\\Delta_c^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(R(z,\\overline z)\\land T_c^z\\land\\Gamma_c(\\overline z,z)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_c(u,v)\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{TC}_{x,y}(R(x,y)\\land T_c^x)](u,v),\\qquad\\Delta_c^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(R(z,\\overline z)\\land T_c^z\\land\\Gamma_c(\\overline z,z)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathsf{ex}(c)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(R(z,\\overline z)\\land T_c^{\\overline z}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\mathsf{ex}(c)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(R(z,\\overline z)\\land T_c^{\\overline z}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathsf{eu}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(\\Gamma_c(z,\\overline z)\\land T_d^{\\overline z}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\mathsf{eu}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(\\Gamma_c(z,\\overline z)\\land T_d^{\\overline z}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathsf{eb}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;\\left(\\Gamma_d(z,\\overline z)\\land\\neg\\left(\\neg(T_c^{\\overline z}\\land T_d^{\\overline z})\\land\\neg\\Delta_d^{\\overline z}\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\mathsf{eb}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;\\left(\\Gamma_d(z,\\overline z)\\land\\neg\\left(\\neg(T_c^{\\overline z}\\land T_d^{\\overline z})\\land\\neg\\Delta_d^{\\overline z}\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem14.29 的证明已在扫描253目视核对。EU、EB 的递归子句沿用原书；本条补出常量、EX、目标文法及实际非空环公式 Δ。Γ 的 TC 取反身闭包，Δ 因保留一条 R 边而不把空路径当环。EB 中的否定合取是析取的完整展开，未引入额外对象语言连接词。</p>\n<p>良定义性按代码树归纳：T 的每个调用只涉及严格子代码；Γ_c、Δ_c 在 T_c 已有后构造有限公式。Δ_d 的展开可能再次绑定外层端点变量名，但该绑定只作用于 Δ 所在子公式，不影响另一合取项中的端点；这正是两变量逻辑可以重复使用变量名的范围规则。每个目标构造只使用 x、y；语义正确性另见翻译定理，不从文法成员关系自动推出。</p>\n<p>本条没有复刻 Fact14.30 的 CTL* 翻译：该事实允许随输入增长的布尔变量，不能把当前不含布尔变量的两域变量目标接口无条件推广为 CTL*。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-tc","status":"resolved","id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k$ 及其构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]；$c,d\\in\\mathcal C_k$。目标语法及 TC 绑定含义采用 [[29-df-fo-tc]]；TC 的体内 $x,y$ 被绑定，应用位置的端点变量不在该绑定范围。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-tc","status":"resolved","id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k$ 及其构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]；$c,d\\in\\mathcal C_k$。目标语法及 TC 绑定含义采用 [[29-df-fo-tc]]；TC 的体内 $x,y$ 被绑定，应用位置的端点变量不在该绑定范围。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k=\\langle R^{(2)},p_0^{(1)},\\ldots,p_{k-1}^{(1)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"Z=\\{x,y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,z\\in Z","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"c,d\\in\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}","display":false},{"tex":"T_c^z,\\Gamma_c(u,v),\\Delta_c^z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline x\\coloneqq y,\\qquad\\overline y\\coloneqq x.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{k,0}^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{u=v,R(u,v)\\mid u,v\\in Z\\}\\cup\\{p_i(u)\\mid u\\in Z\\land 0\\leq i<k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{k,j+1}^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y}\\cup\\{\\neg\\theta,\\theta\\land\\eta,\\exists u\\,\\theta\\mid\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y},\\ u\\in Z\\}\\cup\\{[\\operatorname{TC}_{x,y}\\theta](u,v)\\mid\\theta\\in\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y},\\ u,v\\in Z\\},\\qquad\\mathcal F_k^{x,y}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal F_{k,j}^{x,y}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\top_c}^z\\coloneqq(z=z),\\qquad T_{\\bot_c}^z\\coloneqq\\neg(z=z),\\qquad T_{q_i}^z\\coloneqq p_i(z)\\quad(i<k).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathsf{neg}(c)}^z\\coloneqq\\neg T_c^z,\\qquad T_{\\mathsf{and}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq T_c^z\\land T_d^z.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_c(u,v)\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{TC}_{x,y}(R(x,y)\\land T_c^x)](u,v),\\qquad\\Delta_c^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(R(z,\\overline z)\\land T_c^z\\land\\Gamma_c(\\overline z,z)).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathsf{ex}(c)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(R(z,\\overline z)\\land T_c^{\\overline z}).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathsf{eu}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;(\\Gamma_c(z,\\overline z)\\land T_d^{\\overline z}).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathsf{eb}(c,d)}^z\\coloneqq\\exists\\overline z\\;\\left(\\Gamma_d(z,\\overline z)\\land\\neg\\left(\\neg(T_c^{\\overline z}\\land T_d^{\\overline z})\\land\\neg\\Delta_d^{\\overline z}\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":3536,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]、[[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]、[[29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc]] — EU/EB 的路径与环刻画、显式两变量翻译及正确性"},{"id":"d5d29e8c675bca09","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_k,x,y,Z,\\mathcal F_k^{x,y},T_c^z$ 采用 [[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]；$z\\in Z$。$\\mathfrak A_K$ 在下式构造为 $\\tau_k$ 结构，关系解释的次序与 $\\tau_k$ 一致。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-tc-translation|29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]"}],"outgoing":["f0b39f920854da20","98a7b2fe455fde6b"]}